{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/megacd/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/megacd/", "title": "MegaCD", "content_html": "<p>The MegaCD core is a MiSTer project original developed by <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank} that aims to simulate t...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/megacd.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:40:37+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/megacd/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/megacd/", "title": "MegaCD", "content_html": "<p>MegaCD \u30b3\u30a2\u306f <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank} \u6c0f\u306b\u3088\u308b MiSTer \u30d7\u30ed\u30b8\u30a7\u30af\u30c8\u30aa\u30ea\u30b8\u30ca\u30eb\u3067\u3001Sega Genesis \u7528 Sega CD / Mega CD \u62e1\u5f35\u306e\u30b7\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u76ee\u6307...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/megacd.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:40:37+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/lag/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/lag/", "title": "Lag Explained", "content_html": "<p>A common concern among retro enthusiasts is whether a device like MiSTer has <em>lag</em> and whether it creates a less desirable experience than original hardware....</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/lag.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:39:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/lag/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/lag/", "title": "\u30e9\u30b0\u306e\u89e3\u8aac", "content_html": "<p>\u30ec\u30c8\u30ed\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u611b\u597d\u5bb6\u306e\u9593\u3067\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u61f8\u5ff5\u306f\u3001MiSTer \u306e\u3088\u3046\u306a\u6a5f\u5668\u306b_\u30e9\u30b0_\u304c\u3042\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u5b9f\u6a5f\u3088\u308a\u4f53\u9a13\u304c\u52a3\u308b\u304b\u3069\u3046\u304b\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u96fb\u5b50\u6a5f\u5668\u306b\u306f\u4f55\u3089\u304b\u306e_\u30ec\u30a4\u30c6\u30f3\u30b7\u30fc_\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u300260 Hz \u30c7\u30a3\u30b9\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3067\u306f1\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u7d04 16.67 ms \u3067\u3059\u3002\u30ec\u30a4\u30c6\u30f3\u30b7\u30fc\u306f\u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u76ee\u306b\u898b\u3048\u3066\u843d\u3061\u308b\u524d\u304b\u3089\u554f\u984c\u306b\u306a\u308a...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/lag.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:39:54+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/arcade/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/arcade/", "title": "Arcade Cores", "content_html": "<p>This is a list of the arcade cores on MiSTer. The Supported Games column lists only general game names, not all revisions/versions. [Alternative MRA files](h...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/arcade.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:39:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/computer/", "title": "Computer Cores", "content_html": "<p>This is a list of the computer cores in the MiSTer GitHub repository. In the SDRAM column, \u2714\ufe0f means the core requires an SDRAM board. This table is a manuall...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/computer.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:39:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/console/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/console/", "title": "Console Cores", "content_html": "<p>This is a list of the console cores in the MiSTer GitHub repository. Boot ROM filenames and their meaning differ per core \u2014 check each core's README. (In the...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/console.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:39:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/computer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/computer/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer GitHub \u30ea\u30dd\u30b8\u30c8\u30ea\u30fc\u306b\u3042\u308b\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u4e00\u89a7\u3067\u3059\u3002SDRAM \u5217\u306e \u2714\ufe0f \u306f SDRAM \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u5fc5\u9808\u3092\u610f\u5473\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u8868\u306f\u624b\u52d5\u7ba1\u7406\u306e\u30b9\u30ca\u30c3\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8\u3067\u3001\u6700\u65b0\u30ea\u30ea\u30fc\u30b9\u306b\u9045\u308c\u308b\u3053\u3068\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>| \u30b3\u30a2\u540d                                           ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/computer.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:39:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/console/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/console/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30b3\u30a2", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer GitHub \u30ea\u30dd\u30b8\u30c8\u30ea\u30fc\u306b\u3042\u308b\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30b3\u30a2\u306e\u4e00\u89a7\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30d6\u30fc\u30c8 ROM \u306e\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30eb\u540d\u3068\u610f\u5473\u306f\u30b3\u30a2\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u7570\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5404\u30b3\u30a2\u306e README \u3092\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff08MiSTer \u30d5\u30ec\u30fc\u30e0\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u3067\u306f <code>boot.rom</code> \u306f <code>boot0.rom</code> \u304c\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u306e\u30ec\u30ac\u30b7\u30fc\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30eb\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u306b\u904e\u304e\u307e\u305b\u3093\uff09\u3002SD...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/console.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:39:04+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/editing/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/editing/", "title": "Editing These Docs", "content_html": "<p>This guide shows how to edit this documentation site. It's similar to editing a wiki page, with a few extra steps. All edits are approved by the administrato...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/editing.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/crt/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/crt/", "title": "CRT Connections and Output Modes", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer has two native analog output paths: VGA output from an I/O board, or Direct Video through a compatible HDMI-to-VGA adapter connected to the DE10-Nano'...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/crt.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/setup/play/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/setup/play/", "title": "Play a Game", "content_html": "<p>Next, load the core for the system you want to play; this example uses the NES core. Select Console, then NES, and press Enter or the button you assigned as ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/setup/play.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/setup/software/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/setup/software/", "title": "Set Up the MicroSD Card", "content_html": "<p>First, install the software onto your MicroSD card.</p>\n<h2>Flash Mr. Fusion to your MicroSD card</h2>\n<p>Mr. Fusion provides a compact image that you can download and f...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/setup/software.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/editing/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/editing/", "title": "\u3053\u306e\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u306e\u7de8\u96c6\u65b9\u6cd5", "content_html": "<p>\u3053\u306e\u30ac\u30a4\u30c9\u3067\u306f\u3001\u3053\u306e\u30c9\u30ad\u30e5\u30e1\u30f3\u30c8\u30b5\u30a4\u30c8\u306e\u7de8\u96c6\u65b9\u6cd5\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002wiki \u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306e\u7de8\u96c6\u306b\u4f3c\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001\u3044\u304f\u3064\u304b\u8ffd\u52a0\u306e\u30b9\u30c6\u30c3\u30d7\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\u7de8\u96c6\u306f GitHub \u4e0a\u306e MkDocs_MiSTer \u30ea\u30dd\u30b8\u30c8\u30ea\u30fc\u306e\u7ba1\u7406\u8005\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u627f\u8a8d\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u5909\u66f4\u306e\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ea\u30d3\u30e5\u30fc\u30c8</h2>\n<p>\u307e\u305a GitHub \u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u3067...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/editing.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/crt/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/crt/", "title": "CRT\u63a5\u7d9a\u3068\u51fa\u529b\u30e2\u30fc\u30c9", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u306f2\u3064\u306e\u30cd\u30a4\u30c6\u30a3\u30d6\u30a2\u30ca\u30ed\u30b0\u51fa\u529b\u7d4c\u8def\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002I/O \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u304b\u3089\u306e VGA \u51fa\u529b\u3001\u307e\u305f\u306f DE10-Nano \u306e HDMI \u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u306b\u63a5\u7d9a\u3057\u305f\u4e92\u63db\u6027\u306e\u3042\u308b HDMI-to-VGA \u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc\u7d4c\u7531\u306e Direct Video \u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>*\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u306f MiSTer FPGA GitHub Wiki \u3067...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/crt.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/setup/play/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/setup/play/", "title": "\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u904a\u3076", "content_html": "<p>\u6b21\u306b\u3001\u904a\u3073\u305f\u3044\u6a5f\u7a2e\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u3092\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u4f8b\u3067\u306f NES \u30b3\u30a2\u3092\u4f7f\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002Console \u2192 NES \u3092\u9078\u3073\u3001Enter \u307e\u305f\u306f\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc\u3067 \"A\" \u306b\u5272\u308a\u5f53\u3066\u305f\u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\u3092\u62bc\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30b3\u30a2\u304c\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307e\u308c\u305f\u3089\u3001\u5272\u308a\u5f53\u3066\u305f Menu \u30dc\u30bf\u30f3\uff08\u307e\u305f\u306f\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306e F12\uff09\u3092\u3082\u3046\u4e00\u5ea6\u62bc\u3057\u3066\u30e1\u30cb\u30e5\u30fc\u3092\u958b\u304d\u76f4\u3059\u5fc5\u8981\u304c\u3042\u308b\u5834\u5408...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/setup/play.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/setup/software/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/setup/software/", "title": "microSD\u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u306e\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7", "content_html": "<p>\u307e\u305a\u3001microSD \u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u30bd\u30d5\u30c8\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u3092\u30a4\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30fc\u30eb\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>Mr. Fusion \u3092 microSD \u30ab\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u66f8\u304d\u8fbc\u3080 { #flash-mr-fusion-to-your-microsd-card }</h2>\n<p>Mr. Fusion \u306f\u30b3\u30f3\u30d1\u30af\u30c8\u306a\u30a4\u30e1\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u3001[balenaEtcher](https://w...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/setup/software.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/snippets/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/snippets/", "title": "Useful Snippets", "content_html": "<p>Here are some useful HDL snippets as used throughout the MiSTer project, with sources linked for reference.</p>\n<h2>Simple Clock-Enable Divider</h2>\n<p>In any MiSTer co...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/snippets.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:11+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/video_freak/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/video_freak/", "title": "video_freak", "content_html": "<p><code>video_freak</code> adjusts display-enable timing, cropping, and scaling/aspect-ratio parameters \u2014 it works with the scaler rather than performing all pixel scalin...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/video_freak.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:11+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/video_mixer/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/video_mixer/", "title": "video_mixer", "content_html": "<p><code>video_mixer</code> is a helper module that provides many of the video features the MiSTer framework supplies, including scandoubling, gamma, HQ2x scaling, and fre...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/video_mixer.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T07:38:11+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}